  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During Southern Border’s assault on Heavenly Court’s holy burial forest, Yi Hao Fang looks toward Ba clan’s first supreme elder Ba Shi Ba before using his method on Ba Xiong. Ba Shi Ba nods.",
      "chapters": [
        1706
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_yi_hao_fang",
        "fac_ba_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ba clan’s first supreme elder Ba Shi Ba laughs loudly and tells old man Chen Yi it was not wise to come out of that tortoise shell, and that he will face him. Wu Yong orders a group attack instead. Ba Shi Ba faces Bai Cang Shui’s huge waves, his aura surges, and a profound light shines on the waves.",
      "chapters": [
        1709
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chen-yi-challenge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chen_yi",
        "char_wu_yong",
        "char_bai_cang_shui"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the song stops, Feng Jiu Ge names it destiny song. Ba Shi Ba snorts coldly at the talk of destiny.",
      "chapters": [
        1726
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cold-reply",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ba Shi Ba says times are different, and that they need people outside the formation to watch for Heavenly Court reinforcements. He cultivates rule path. Wu Yong keeps him outside with Yi Hao Fang as one of two rank eights on that watch.",
      "chapters": [
        1727
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cultivation-rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Li Huang and Qing Ye arrive. Ba Shi Ba fights Qing Ye. He shrieks and sends profound lights that stab and slash, stacking consecutive hits. Qing Ye activates an immortal killer move, vanishes, and turns into darkness that expands like ink in water. Ba Shi Ba hesitates and identifies it as Qing Ye’s signature killer move, expanding night sky. It is an immortal battlefield that can keep growing. He flies backwards at once, because if he went in, his rule path would be weakened by the dark path environment.",
      "chapters": [
        1731
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fight-with-qing-ye",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_li_huang",
        "char_qing_ye"
      ]
    }
  ],
